{"id":"w-h1-39a","pp":10,"note":"합성함수는 ‘안쪽부터’, 역함수는 ‘거꾸로 되돌리기’예요. f^{−1}(a)는 f(□) = a인 □를 찾는 것이라는 뜻을 먼저 잡게 해 주세요.","tips":{"1":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","2":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","3":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","4":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","5":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터"},"items":[{"no":1,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = 3x − 1, g(x) = −x^{2} − 3x + 2일 때, (f∘g)(2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−25","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(2) = −2^{2} − 3 × 2 + 2 = −8","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(2) = f(−8) = 3 × (−8) − 1 = −25"}],"ap":"−25","omr":"num"},{"no":2,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = −3x + 5, g(x) = −x^{2} + 2일 때, (g∘f)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−119","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−2) = −3 × (−2) + 5 = 11","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−2) = g(11) = −11^{2} + 2 = −119"}],"ap":"−119","omr":"num"},{"no":3,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = 4x + 3, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 2x + 3일 때, (f∘g)(−1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"31","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−1) = 2 × (−1)^{2} − 2 × (−1) + 3 = 7","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−1) = f(7) = 4 × 7 + 3 = 31"}],"ap":"31","omr":"num"},{"no":4,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = −2x + 5, g(x) = x^{2} + 2x − 2일 때, (g∘f)(2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"1","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(2) = −2 × 2 + 5 = 1","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(2) = g(1) = 1^{2} + 2 × 1 − 2 = 1"}],"ap":"1","omr":"num"},{"no":5,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = 4x − 3, g(x) = 2x^{2} + 2x − 2일 때, (f∘g)(1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"5","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(1) = 2 × 1^{2} + 2 × 1 − 2 = 2","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(1) = f(2) = 4 × 2 − 3 = 5"}],"ap":"5","omr":"num"},{"no":6,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = −3x + 4, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 2x + 3일 때, (g∘f)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"63","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(3) = −3 × 3 + 4 = −5","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(3) = g(−5) = 2 × (−5)^{2} − 2 × (−5) + 3 = 63"}],"ap":"63","omr":"num"},{"no":7,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = −2x − 5, g(x) = 2x^{2} + 3x일 때, (f∘g)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−59","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(3) = 2 × 3^{2} + 3 × 3 = 27","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(3) = f(27) = −2 × 27 − 5 = −59"}],"ap":"−59","omr":"num"},{"no":8,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = 3x + 5, g(x) = −x^{2} − x일 때, (g∘f)(0)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−30","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(0) = 3 × 0 + 5 = 5","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(0) = g(5) = −5^{2} − 5 = −30"}],"ap":"−30","omr":"num"},{"no":9,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 4x − 3, g(x) = −x^{2} + x + 2일 때, (f∘g)(0)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"5","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(0) = −0^{2} + 0 + 2 = 2","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(0) = f(2) = 4 × 2 − 3 = 5"}],"ap":"5","omr":"num"},{"no":10,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 4x − 6, g(x) = −x^{2} + x + 3일 때, (g∘f)(1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−3","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(1) = 4 × 1 − 6 = −2","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(1) = g(−2) = −(−2)^{2} + (−2) + 3 = −3"}],"ap":"−3","omr":"num"},{"no":11,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 4x + 3, g(x) = −x^{2}일 때, (f∘g)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−13","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−2) = −(−2)^{2} = −4","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−2) = f(−4) = 4 × (−4) + 3 = −13"}],"ap":"−13","omr":"num"},{"no":12,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 3x − 1, g(x) = −x^{2} + 2x + 2일 때, (g∘f)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−46","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(3) = 3 × 3 − 1 = 8","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(3) = g(8) = −8^{2} + 2 × 8 + 2 = −46"}],"ap":"−46","omr":"num"},{"no":13,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = −3x − 4, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 2x − 3일 때, (f∘g)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−31","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−2) = 2 × (−2)^{2} − 2 × (−2) − 3 = 9","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−2) = f(9) = −3 × 9 − 4 = −31"}],"ap":"−31","omr":"num"},{"no":14,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 4, g(x) = x^{2} + 2x − 4일 때, (g∘f)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"44","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−2) = 2 × (−2) − 4 = −8","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−2) = g(−8) = (−8)^{2} + 2 × (−8) − 4 = 44"}],"ap":"44","omr":"num"},{"no":15,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = 2x + 2, g(x) = −x^{2} + 3x − 1일 때, (f∘g)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−20","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−2) = −(−2)^{2} + 3 × (−2) − 1 = −11","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−2) = f(−11) = 2 × (−11) + 2 = −20"}],"ap":"−20","omr":"num"},{"no":16,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = 4x + 1, g(x) = −x^{2} + 3x − 3일 때, (g∘f)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−157","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−3) = 4 × (−3) + 1 = −11","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−3) = g(−11) = −(−11)^{2} + 3 × (−11) − 3 = −157"}],"ap":"−157","omr":"num"},{"no":17,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = −3x − 4, g(x) = x^{2} − 3x − 1일 때, (f∘g)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−1","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(3) = 3^{2} − 3 × 3 − 1 = −1","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(3) = f(−1) = −3 × (−1) − 4 = −1"}],"ap":"−1","omr":"num"},{"no":18,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = −2x + 3, g(x) = 2x^{2} − x − 2일 때, (g∘f)(2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"1","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(2) = −2 × 2 + 3 = −1","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(2) = g(−1) = 2 × (−1)^{2} − (−1) − 2 = 1"}],"ap":"1","omr":"num"},{"no":19,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 1, g(x) = x^{2} − 2x − 1일 때, (f∘g)(−1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"3","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−1) = (−1)^{2} − 2 × (−1) − 1 = 2","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−1) = f(2) = 2 × 2 − 1 = 3"}],"ap":"3","omr":"num"},{"no":20,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = −2x − 5, g(x) = x^{2} − 2x + 2일 때, (g∘f)(0)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"37","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(0) = −2 × 0 − 5 = −5","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(0) = g(−5) = (−5)^{2} − 2 × (−5) + 2 = 37"}],"ap":"37","omr":"num"}]}